pplication Begin : <strong>19/08/2025</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">Last Date for Apply : <span style=\"color: #ff0000\"><b>17/09/2025</b></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">Fee Payment Last Date : <b>17/09/2025</b></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">Exam Date : <strong>12-18 July 2026</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">Admit Card Available : <b>09/07/2026</b></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">Answer Key Available : <strong>28/07/2026</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 31.5577%;text-align: center;height: 224px\" colspan=\"2\">\n<h3><span style=\"color: #008000\"><strong>Application Fees</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">General / Other State : <b>600</b>/-</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">OBC / BC / SC / ST / PH : <b>400</b>/-</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">Pay the Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / Online Only.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 197px\">\n<td style=\"width: 66.3943%;height: 197px\" colspan=\"6\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><b>RPSC Senior Teacher TGT Notification 2025 : <span style=\"color: #ff00ff\">Age Limit as on 01/01/2026</span></b></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Minimum Age : <b>18 Years.</b></li>\n<li>Maximum Age : <b>40 Years.</b></li>\n<li>Age Relaxation as per RPSC Senior Teacher Grade II Recruitment 2025 Rules.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 104px\">\n<td style=\"width: 66.3943%;height: 104px\" colspan=\"6\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><b>RPSC TGT Recruitment 2025 :&nbsp; <span style=\"color: #008000\">Vacancy Details Total : 9651 Post</span></b></span></h2>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse;width: 100%;height: 127px\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 76px\">\n<td style=\"width: 16%;text-align: center;height: 76px\" width=\"16%\"><strong>Post Name</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 11%;text-align: center;height: 76px\" width=\"11%\"><strong>Non-TSP Area Posts</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 10%;text-align: center;height: 76px\" width=\"10%\"><strong>TSP Area Posts</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 11%;text-align: center;height: 76px\" width=\"11%\"><strong>Total Post</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%;text-align: center;height: 76px\" width=\"50%\"><strong>RPSC Senior Teacher Eligibility 2025</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 16%;text-align: center\" width=\"16%\">Hindi</td>\n<td style=\"width: 11%;text-align: center\" width=\"11%\">1577</td>\n<td style=\"width: 10%;text-align: center\" width=\"10%\">47</td>\n<td style=\"width: 11%;text-align: center\" width=\"11%\">1624</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%\" width=\"50%\">\n<ul>\n<li>Graduate or equivalent with Hindi as an Optional Subject, AND Degree or Diploma in Education</li>\n<li>Working knowledge of Hindi in Devnagari Script and knowledge of Rajasthani culture.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 16%;text-align: center\" width=\"16%\">English</td>\n<td style=\"width: 11%;text-align: center\" width=\"11%\">1956</td>\n<td style=\"width: 10%;text-align: center\" width=\"10%\">155</td>\n<td style=\"width: 11%;text-align: center\" width=\"11%\">2111</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%\" width=\"50%\">\n<ul>\n<li>Graduate or equivalent with English as an Optional Subject, AND Degree or Diploma in Education.</li>\n<li>Working knowledge of Hindi in Devnagari Script and knowledge of Rajasthani culture.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 16%;text-align: center\" width=\"16%\">Sanskrit</td>\n<td style=\"width: 11%;text-align: center\" width=\"11%\">1323</td>\n<td style=\"width: 10%;text-align: center\" width=\"10%\">98</td>\n<td style=\"width: 11%;text-align: center\" width=\"11%\">1421</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%\" width=\"50%\">\n<ul>\n<li>Graduate or equivalent with Sanskrit as an Optional Subject, AND Degree or Diploma in Education.</li>\n<li>Working knowledge of Hindi in Devnagari Script and knowledge of Rajasthani culture.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 16%;text-align: center\" width=\"16%\">Mathematics</td>\n<td style=\"width: 11%;text-align: center\" width=\"11%\">2076</td>\n<td style=\"width: 10%;text-align: center\" width=\"10%\">201</td>\n<td style=\"width: 11%;text-align: center\" width=\"11%\">2277</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%\" width=\"50%\">\n<ul>\n<li>Graduate or equivalent with Mathematics as an Optional Subject, AND Degree or Diploma in Education.</li>\n<li>Working knowledge of Hindi in Devnagari Script and knowledge of Rajasthani culture.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 16%;text-align: center\" width=\"16%\">Science</td>\n<td style=\"width: 11%;text-align: center\" width=\"11%\">2031</td>\n<td style=\"width: 10%;text-align: center\" width=\"10%\">195</td>\n<td style=\"width: 11%;text-align: center\" width=\"11%\">2226</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%\" width=\"50%\">\n<ul>\n<li>Graduate or equivalent with at least two of the following as Optional Subjects: Physics, Chemistry, Zoology, Botany, Micro-Biology, Bio-Technology, Bio-Chemistry, AND Degree or Diploma in Education. Rojgar Result</li>\n<li>Working knowledge of Hindi in Devnagari Script and knowledge of Rajasthani culture.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 16%;text-align: center\" width=\"16%\">Social Science</td>\n<td style=\"width: 11%;text-align: center\" width=\"11%\">600</td>\n<td style=\"width: 10%;text-align: center\" width=\"10%\">0</td>\n<td style=\"width: 11%;text-align: center\" width=\"11%\">600</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%\" width=\"50%\">\n<ul>\n<li>Graduate or equivalent with at least two of the following as Optional Subjects: History, Geography, Economics, Political Science, Sociology, Public Administration, Philosophy, AND Degree or Diploma in Education.</li>\n<li>Working knowledge of Hindi in Devnagari Script and knowledge of Rajasthani culture.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 16%;text-align: center\" width=\"16%\">Urdu</td>\n<td style=\"width: 11%;text-align: center\" width=\"11%\">71</td>\n<td style=\"width: 10%;text-align: center\" width=\"10%\">0</td>\n<td style=\"width: 11%;text-align: center\" width=\"11%\">71</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%\" width=\"50%\">\n<ul>\n<li>Graduate or equivalent with Urdu as an Optional Subject, AND Degree or Diploma in Education.</li>\n<li>Working knowledge of Hindi in Devnagari Script and knowledge of Rajasthani culture.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 16%;text-align: center\" width=\"16%\">Punjabi</td>\n<td style=\"width: 11%;text-align: center\" width=\"11%\">14</td>\n<td style=\"width: 10%;text-align: center\" width=\"10%\">0</td>\n<td style=\"width: 11%;text-align: center\" width=\"11%\">14</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%\" width=\"50%\">\n<ul>\n<li>Graduate or equivalent with Punjabi as an Optional Subject, AND Degree or Diploma in Education.</li>\n<li>Working knowledge of Hindi in Devnagari Script and knowledge of Rajasthani culture.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 16%;text-align: center\" width=\"16%\">Sindhi</td>\n<td style=\"width: 11%;text-align: center\" width=\"11%\">2</td>\n<td style=\"width: 10%;text-align: center\" width=\"10%\">0</td>\n<td style=\"width: 11%;text-align: center\" width=\"11%\">2</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%\" width=\"50%\">\n<ul>\n<li>Graduate or equivalent with Sindhi as an Optional Subject, AND Degree or Diploma in Education.</li>\n<li>Working knowledge of Hindi in Devnagari Script and knowledge of Rajasthani culture.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 16%;text-align: center\" width=\"16%\">Gujarati</td>\n<td style=\"width: 11%;text-align: center\" width=\"11%\">1</td>\n<td style=\"width: 10%;text-align: center\" width=\"10%\">0</td>\n<td style=\"width: 11%;text-align: center\" width=\"11%\">1</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%\" width=\"50%\">\n<ul>\n<li>Graduate or equivalent with Gujarati as an Optional Subject, AND Degree or Diploma in Education.</li>\n<li>Working knowledge of Hindi in Devnagari Script and knowledge of Rajasthani culture.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px\">\n<td style=\"width: 66.3943%;height: 25px\" colspan=\"6\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><b>How to Fill RPSC Sr. Teacher TGT <span style=\"color: #ff00ff\">Online Form 2025</span></b></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Rajasthan Public Service Commission has Released the RPSC Senior Teacher Grade II Online Form 2026 Notification. Candidate Can Apply Between <b>19 August 2025 to 17 September 2025.<br>\n</b></li>\n<li>Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the Recruitment Application Form in RPSC Senior Teacher Grade II Pre Online 2026.</li>\n<li>Kindly Check and College the All Document – Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</li>\n<li>Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Recruitment Form – Photo, Sign, ID Proof, Etc.</li>\n<li>Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</li>\n<li>Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</li>\n<li>For the latest updates on Sarkari Result, admit card, answer key, and result, always visit SarkariResult.com, the official website for Sarkari Result in India (Since 2012).</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px\">\n<td style=\"width: 66.3943%;height: 25px\" colspan=\"6\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><b>Interested Candidates Can Read the Full Notification Before Apply Online</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px\">\n<td style=\"width: 66.3943%;height: 25px\" colspan=\"6\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px\">\n<td style=\"width: 34.8366%;height: 25px;text-align: center\" colspan=\"4\">\n\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 31.5577%;height: 25px;text-align: center\" colspan=\"2\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px\">\n<td style=\"width: 66.3943%;height: 25px;text-align: center\" colspan=\"6\">\n<h2><span style=\"color: #008000\"><strong>Som