"color: #ff00ff\"><strong>Download Exam Schedule</strong></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;height: 62px\" colspan=\"2\">\n<h2></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 104px\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;height: 36px\" colspan=\"4\">\n<h2><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><strong>Apply Online</strong></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;height: 36px\" colspan=\"2\">\n<h2><a title=\"RPSC Sr. Teacher Online Form 2025\" href=\"https://sso.rajasthan.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 62px\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;height: 62px;width: 34.8366%\" colspan=\"4\">\n<h2><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><strong>Download Notification</strong></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;width: 31.5577%;height: 62px\" colspan=\"2\">\n<h2><a title=\"RPSC Rajasthan TGT Notification 2026\" href=\"https://rpsc.rajasthan.gov.in/Static/RecruitmentAdvertisements/ED4F69C3BFA14F9BBACDC0077554C90D.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 62px\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;height: 62px;width: 34.8366%\" colspan=\"4\">\n\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;width: 31.5577%;height: 62px\" colspan=\"2\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 62px\">\n<td style=\"width: 34.8366%;text-align: center;height: 62px\" colspan=\"4\">\n<h2><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;width: 31.5577%;height: 62px\" colspan=\"2\">\n<h2><a title=\"RPSC TGT Official Website 2026\" href=\"https://rpsc.rajasthan.gov.in/news\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n\n\n<div>\n\n<!-- Internal_header_07-11-2024 -->\n\n\n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-6da1cb96\">\n\n<h3 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-325acb59\"><span class=\"gb-icon\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" role=\"img\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M207.029 381.476L12.686 187.132c-9.373-9.373-9.373-24.569 0-33.941l22.667-22.667c9.357-9.357 24.522-9.375 33.901-.04L224 284.505l154.745-154.021c9.379-9.335 24.544-9.317 33.901.04l22.667 22.667c9.373 9.373 9.373 24.569 0 33.941L240.971 381.476c-9.373 9.372-24.569 9.372-33.942 0z\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"gb-headline-text\"><strong><em>Frequently Asked Questions</em></strong></span></h3>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-97950a91 gb-headline-text\"><h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"1nlecbm\" data-start=\"39\" data-end=\"96\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff0000\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\">1. RPSC Senior Teacher TGT Online Form Start Date?</span></span></strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"97\" data-end=\"178\">The online application process started on <strong>19 August 2025.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"1e84k3r\" data-start=\"435\" data-end=\"474\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><strong>2. RPSC Senior Teacher TGT 07/2025 Exam Date 2026?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"475\" data-end=\"553\">The Examination will be conducted in <strong>12-18 July 2026</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"o0mtqe\" data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"592\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><strong>3. Where can I find the syllabus for the Rajasthan RPSC Sr. Teacher TGT 07/2025 Examination?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"655\">The detailed syllabus and examination scheme for the RPSC Rajasthan TGT Sr. Teacher Examination are available in the official notification. Candidates are advised to read the notification carefully for complete syllabus details.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"o0mtqe\" data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"592\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><strong>4. RPSC TGT Sr. Teacher Notification PDF?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"655\">Candidates can download the notification through SarkariResult.com.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"kyy6a2\" data-start=\"180\" data-end=\"221\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><strong>5. Rajasthan RPSC Senior Teacher Grade II TGT Recruitment Last Date?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"222\" data-end=\"305\">The last date to apply online is <strong>17 September 2025.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"1dih1sd\" data-start=\"307\" data-end=\"359\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><strong>6. What is the last date to Update application fee Details?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"360\" data-end=\"433\">Candidates can pay the application fee up to <strong>17 September 2025</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"o0mtqe\" data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"592\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><strong>7. How can I apply for RPSC Rajasthan Sr. Teacher Grade II TGT Exam?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"655\">Candidates can apply online through the official recruitment link available on <strong data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1334\">SarkariResult.com (Since 2012) – Official Website of Sarkari Result®</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<figure id=\"attachment_25531\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-25531\" style=\"width: 2550px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-25531\" title=\"Sarkari Result Rajasthan RPSC TGT Senior Teacher Exam City / Admit Card 2026 Direct Link\" src=\"https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/rpsctgt-scaled.png\" alt=\"Sa